{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794233770,"nonce":"tpt92sEbJ7oe0DNomQ8obgC48q8=","title":"L1 — Allocation-free lookups for (root, id)-keyed UI state","message":"## Context\n`App` keys per-issue UI state by `(PathBuf, String)` tuples, so every lookup from the view must clone both parts to build a key. This runs per row, per frame. `is_pending` sidesteps it with an O(n) linear scan instead.\n\n## Files\n- `src/app.rs:293` — `expanded: HashSet\u003c(PathBuf, String)\u003e`\n- `src/app.rs:300` — `pending`, `:302` `write_errors`, `:304` `drafts`; same key shape\n- `src/app.rs:1417` — `is_pending`: `self.pending.iter().any(...)` linear scan\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:426` — `epic_card` clones root + epic id to query `expanded`\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:1047` — issue row clones root + id to query `write_errors`\n- `src/ui/detail.rs:167`, `:187` — detail pane clones to build keys\n\n## Approach\n- Introduce a small `IssueMap\u003cV\u003e` / `IssueSet` (nested `HashMap\u003cPathBuf, HashMap\u003cString, V\u003e\u003e`) with `get(\u0026Path, \u0026str)`, `contains(\u0026Path, \u0026str)`, `insert(PathBuf, String, V)`, `remove(\u0026Path, \u0026str)` so lookups borrow.\n- Replace the four fields with it; rewrite `is_pending` as an O(1) `contains`.\n- Update view call sites to pass `\u0026entry.info.root, \u0026issue.id` without cloning.\n- Keep `detail.rs:37` `DetailCache` key as-is unless trivially covered.\n\n## Out of scope\n- `cursor: Option\u003c(PathBuf, String)\u003e` (single value, compared by ref already).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- No `.clone()` of root/id used solely to build a lookup key in `src/ui/screen.rs` or `src/ui/detail.rs`\n- `is_pending` no longer iterates the set\n- Existing app tests pass unchanged in behavior (`cargo test`); clippy and fmt gates pass","files":null}]}